1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
May 2024, Rio Grande do Sul. Alerts said where floods could happen, not where.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Tipping Point replays it: extreme rain, saturated soil —

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Flagged 85 hours before the damage.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
NISAR radar sees through the clouds: 28 square kilometers of flood candidates.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:22,000
On the 7% optical could see, radar overlaps at F1 0.15.

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:27,000
230,000 people in critical areas, prioritized for Civil Defense.

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,500
Rain warns. Radar confirms.
